+// DOS-PORT (patch 0097, Phase 9 wave 23 W23A Path B tilemap cache):
+// 13 cache hit/miss instrumentation counters per
+// docs/PHASE11-WAVE-23-CONTRACT.md § 1.4. These accumulate per-100-
+// tick block; emit + reset (12 of 13) at audit-flush, sticky
+// `*_enabled` flags reset only on map_flush_graphics() (map change).
+// Storage definitions live in Renderer.cpp's NXE::Diag block alongside
+// W20B + W22A + W22.5 storage so audit-flush emits all 5
+// instrumentation layers from a single TU.
