+// Adaptive-α state machine (per design § 5 Option α, contract § 5):
+//   - per-layer `*_enabled` flag starts true; transitions to false
+//     after 10 consecutive frames where miss_render_time < 2 ×
+//     cache_hit_cost (BG threshold 8.6 ms; FG threshold 15.4 ms;
+//     hardcoded per probe data § 11.6)
